#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:24
msgid "Effects and Filters"
msgstr "Efekty a filtre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:26
msgid ""
"Effects and Filters are very important components in video editing. In "
"Kdenlive, effects and filters are provided by |frei0r| or |avfilter| "
"(Kdenlive does not have built-in effects or filters of its own)."
msgstr ""
"Efekty a filtre sú veľmi dôležité komponenty pri strihání videa. V Kdenlive "
"sú efekty a filtre poskytované prostredníctvom |frei0r| alebo |avfilter| "
"(Kdenlive nemá vlastné vstavané efekty ani filtre)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:30
msgid ""
"Effects are used to change the appearance of or manipulate a clip. For "
"example, the **Transform** effect allows to scale and move the clip; the "
"**Brightness** effect changes the brightness of the clip; effects in the "
"*Alpha, Mask and Keying* category provide very specific filters for masking "
"or rotoscoping."
msgstr ""
"Efekty slúžia na zmenu vzhľadu alebo manipuláciu s klipom. Napríklad efekt "
"**Transform** umožňuje škálovanie a presúvanie klipu; efekt **Brightness** "
"mení jas klipu; efekty v kategórii *Alpha, Mask and Keying* poskytujú veľmi "
"špecifické filtre pre maskovanie alebo rotoskopovanie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:37
msgid ""
"Kdenlive has two groups of effects: :ref:`Video Effects <effects-"
"video_effects>` and :ref:`Audio Effects <effects-audio_effects>`."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive má dve skupiny efektov: :ref:`Video Effects <effects-"
"video_effects>` a :ref:`Audio Effects <effects-audio_effects>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:39
msgid "There are several ways to apply effects:"
msgstr "Existuje niekoľko spôsobov, ako použiť efekty:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:41
msgid ""
"On the clip in the Project Bin, which makes the effect available in all "
"instances of that clip in the Timeline"
msgstr ""
"Na klipu v Zásobníku projektu, čím sa efekt sprístupní vo všetkých výskytoch "
"daného klipu na Časovej osi"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:43
msgid ""
"On the clip in the Timeline, which makes the effect only applicable for that "
"clip in the Timeline at that point"
msgstr ""
"Na klipu na Časovej osi, čím sa efekt vzťahuje iba na daný klip na Časovej "
"osi v danom mieste"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:45
msgid ""
"On the track, which applies the effect to all clips in that particular track"
msgstr "Na stope, čím sa efekt použije na všetky klipy v danej stope"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:47
msgid "On Master, which applies that effect to all clips in all tracks"
msgstr "Na Master, čím sa efekt použije na všetky klipy vo všetkých stopách"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:49
msgid ""
"Not all effects can be used at the track or Master level nor does it make "
"sense."
msgstr ""
"Nie všetky efekty je možné použiť na úrovni stopy alebo Master, ani by to "
"nedávalo zmysel."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:55
msgid "Built-in Effects"
msgstr "Zvukové efekty"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:59
msgid ""
"The built-in effects are disabled by default. So you have to enable it "
"before you can use it."
msgstr ""
"Vstavané efekty sú predvolene vypnuté. Pred použitím ich musíte povoliť."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:61
msgid ""
"All built-in effects can be disabled/enabled globally in :menuselection:"
"`Settings --> Configure Kdenlive -> Misc`"
msgstr ""
"Všetky vstavané efekty je možné globálne vypnúť/zapnúť v :menuselection:"
"`Settings --> Configure Kdenlive -> Misc`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:68
msgid ""
"Under **Misc** you can disable/enable all built-in effects. Default is "
"**disabled**."
msgstr ""
"V časti **Misc** môžete vypnúť/zapnúť všetky vstavané efekty. Predvolené "
"nastavenie je **vypnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:72
msgid ""
"When dragging a clip into the timeline, the :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/flippo>` and :doc:`Transform </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform>` "
"effects are always added to the video part of the clip; for the audio part "
"the :doc:`Volume </effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/"
"volume_keyframable>` effect is added by default."
msgstr ""
"Pri pretiahnutí klipu na časovú os sa k video časti klipu vždy pridajú "
"efekty :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>` a :doc:`Transform </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform>`; "
"k audio časti sa predvolene pridá efekt :doc:`Volume </effects_and_filters/"
"audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:74
msgid ""
"These are the most used effects which you now have at your fingertips "
"without the need to add them manually."
msgstr ""
"Toto sú najpoužívanejšie efekty, ktoré máte teraz po ruke bez potreby ich "
"manuálneho pridávania."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:76
msgid "|video-effect| < video part | audio part > |audio-effect|"
msgstr "|video-effect| < video časť | audio časť > |audio-effect|"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:78
msgid "video-effect"
msgstr "Zvukové efekty"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:81
msgid "audio-effect"
msgstr "Zvukové efekty"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:84
msgid "Built-in effects can be used in four places:"
msgstr "Vstavané efekty je možné použiť na štyroch miestach:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:86
msgid ""
"on a clip in the project bin (:doc:`Transform </effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform>` and :doc:`Flip </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/flippo>`, "
"audio part: :doc:`Volume </effects_and_filters/audio_effects/"
"volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`)"
msgstr ""
"na klipu v zásobníku projektu (:doc:`Transform </effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform>` a :doc:`Flip </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/flippo>`, "
"audio časť: :doc:`Volume </effects_and_filters/audio_effects/"
"volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:88
msgid ""
"on the timeline when a clip is clicked (video part: :doc:`Transform </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform>` "
"and :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>`, audio part: :doc:`Volume </"
"effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`)"
msgstr ""
"na časovej osi po kliknutí na klip (video časť: :doc:`Transform </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform>` "
"a :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>`, audio časť: :doc:`Volume </"
"effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:90
msgid ""
"on the track header (only :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>` on video track and :doc:`Volume </"
"effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>` "
"on audio track)"
msgstr ""
"v hlavičke stopy (iba :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>` na video stope a :doc:`Volume </"
"effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>` "
"na audio stope)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:92
msgid ""
"as master effect (only :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>` and :doc:`Volume </"
"effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`)"
msgstr ""
"ako master efekt (iba :doc:`Flip </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/flippo>` a :doc:`Volume </effects_and_filters/"
"audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/volume_keyframable>`)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:101
msgid "Effects Tab"
msgstr "Karta Efekty"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:105
msgid ""
"Make the Effects widget visible in :menuselection:`Menu --> View --> "
"Effects`."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazenie widgetu Efekty nastavíte v :menuselection:`Menu --> View --> "
"Effects`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:107
msgid ""
"The Effects widget has eight control icons that show or hide the different "
"effect categories:"
msgstr ""
"Widget Efekty má osem riadiacich ikon, ktoré zobrazujú alebo skrývajú rôzne "
"kategórie efektov:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:114
msgid "Kdenlive Effects widget as a tab in the Project Bin area"
msgstr "Widget Efekty Kdenlive ako karta v oblasti Zásobníka projektu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:116
msgid ""
"|show-all-effects|\\ :guilabel:`Main effects` shows all video and audio "
"effects (default view)"
msgstr ""
"|show-all-effects|\\ :guilabel:`Main effects` zobrazuje všetky video a audio "
"efekty (predvolené zobrazenie)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:118
msgid ""
"|kdenlive-show-video|\\ :guilabel:`Show all video effects` shows all video "
"effect categories only"
msgstr ""
"|kdenlive-show-video|\\ :guilabel:`Show all video effects` zobrazuje iba "
"všetky kategórie video efektov"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:120
msgid ""
"|kdenlive-audio|\\ :guilabel:`Show all audio effects` shows all audio "
"effects categories only"
msgstr ""
"|kdenlive-audio|\\ :guilabel:`Show all audio effects` zobrazuje iba všetky "
"kategórie audio efektov"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:122
msgid ""
"|kdenlive-custom-effect|\\ :guilabel:`Show all custom effects` shows all "
"effects :ref:`you have created <effects-custom>` by saving an effect stack."
msgstr ""
"|kdenlive-custom-effect|\\ :guilabel:`Show all custom effects` zobrazuje "
"všetky efekty, ktoré ste :ref:`vytvorili <effects-custom>` uložením "
"zásobníka efektov."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:126
msgid ""
"|favorite|\\ :guilabel:`Show all favorite items` shows all effects that were "
"flagged as a favorite effect. This is the same list that appears when "
"selecting :guilabel:`Insert an effect` from the right-click menu of a clip "
"in the Timeline, or by clicking the :guilabel:`Favorite Effects` in the "
"Timeline toolbar."
msgstr ""
"|favorite|\\ :guilabel:`Show all favorite items` zobrazuje všetky efekty "
"označené ako obľúbené. Ide o rovnaký zoznam, ktorý sa zobrazí pri výbere :"
"guilabel:`Insert an effect` z kontextovej ponuky klipu na Časovej osi alebo "
"kliknutím na :guilabel:`Favorite Effects` na paneli nástrojov Časovej osi."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:128
msgid ""
"|edit-download|\\ :guilabel:`Download New Effects` opens a dialog window "
"where effect templates are listed from the KDE Store"
msgstr ""
"|edit-download|\\ :guilabel:`Download New Effects` otvorí dialógové okno so "
"zoznamom šablón efektov z KDE Store"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:130
msgid ""
"|view-filter|\\ :guilabel:`Only show reviewed assets` toggles between the "
"effects which are reviewed and tested by the Kdenlive team and not tested "
"effects (still in test phase). :guilabel:`Show 10 bit compatible only` it "
"hides assets not compatible with a 10-bit pipeline. Use the :guilabel:`10 "
"Bit` category or the :guilabel:`NVENC H265 ABR 10 bit` codec for :ref:"
"`rendering <rendering_preset_categories>`."
msgstr ""
"|view-filter|\\ :guilabel:`Only show reviewed assets` prepína medzi efektmi, "
"ktoré boli skontrolované a otestované tímom Kdenlive, a efektami, ktoré ešte "
"testované neboli (stále vo fáze testovania). :guilabel:`Show 10 bit "
"compatible only` skryje assety nekompatibilné s 10-bitovým spracovaním. Pre :"
"ref:`renderovanie <rendering_preset_categories>` použite kategóriu :guilabel:"
"`10 Bit` alebo kodek :guilabel:`NVENC H265 ABR 10 bit`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:133
msgid ""
"|help-about|\\ :guilabel:`Show/hide description of effects` toggles the "
"information display below the effect list where a short description of what "
"the effect does is displayed when on. Click on the blue effect text opens "
"the online documentation to this effect."
msgstr ""
"|help-about|\\ :guilabel:`Show/hide description of effects` prepína "
"zobrazenie informácií pod zoznamom efektov, kde sa pri zapnutí zobrazuje "
"stručný popis efektu. Kliknutím na modrý text efektu sa otvorí online "
"dokumentácia k danému efektu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:139
msgid "Effect/Composition Stack"
msgstr "Kompozícia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:141
msgid ""
"This widget is also known as the Properties Tab as it lists all effects "
"applied to the currently selected clip as well as each effect's settings or "
"properties. If a Composition is selected the widget displays the "
"composition's settings or properties."
msgstr ""
"Tento widget je tiež známy ako karta Vlastnosti, pretože zobrazuje všetky "
"efekty použité na aktuálne vybraný klip spolu s nastaveniami alebo "
"vlastnosťami každého efektu. Ak je vybraná kompozícia, widget zobrazuje "
"nastavenia alebo vlastnosti kompozície."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:143
msgid "|effect| < effect | composition > |composition|"
msgstr "|effect| < efekt | kompozícia > |composition|"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:145
msgid "effect"
msgstr "efekt"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:148
msgid "composition"
msgstr "Kompozície"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:151
msgid "Only Effects can be stacked, Compositions cannot."
msgstr "Iba efekty je možné ukladať do zásobníka, kompozície nie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:157
msgid "Effect/Composition Stack Functions"
msgstr "Funkcie zásobníka efektov/kompozícií"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:163
msgid "Kdenlive Effect Stack"
msgstr "Zásobník efektov Kdenlive"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:165
msgid ""
"|document-save-all| Save Effect - Opens a dialog window for entering a name "
"for the effect stack under which it will be listed in the *Custom* effect "
"category and a comment which will be displayed in the information display"
msgstr ""
"|document-save-all| Uložiť efekt – Otvorí dialógové okno na zadanie názvu "
"zásobníka efektov, pod ktorým bude uvedený v kategórii efektov *Custom*, a "
"komentára, ktorý sa zobrazí v informačnom paneli"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:167
msgid ""
"|view-split-left-right| Compare Effect - Splits the Preview Monitor "
"vertically to do a side-by-side comparison of the clip with and without "
"effects"
msgstr ""
"|view-split-left-right| Porovnať efekt – Rozdelí Monitor náhľadu zvisle na "
"porovnanie klipu s efektmi a bez efektov vedľa seba"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:169
msgid ""
"|visibility| Effects enabled - Switches the effect stack on or off. This is "
"equivalent to disabling all effects in the effect stack."
msgstr ""
"|visibility| Efekty zapnuté – Zapne alebo vypne zásobník efektov. Je to "
"ekvivalent vypnutia všetkých efektov v zásobníku efektov."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:171
msgid ""
"|keyframe-disable| Hide/Show keyframes in Timeline - Switches the display of "
"keyframes in the clip in the Timeline on or off"
msgstr ""
"|keyframe-disable| Skryť/Zobraziť kľúčové snímky na Časovej osi – Zapína "
"alebo vypína zobrazenie kľúčových snímok klipu na Časovej osi"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:177
msgid ""
"When an effect is applied to a clip in the timeline you can click on the "
"effect button to enable/disable the clip stack of this clip. When disabled "
"the effect name on the clip is strikeout."
msgstr ""
"Keď je na klip na časovej osi použitý efekt, môžete kliknúť na tlačidlo "
"efektu a zapnúť/vypnúť zásobník klipu. Po vypnutí je názov efektu na klipe "
"prečiarknutý."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:183
msgid "Kdenlive Effect Stack disabled by click on the effect of a clip"
msgstr "Zásobník efektov Kdenlive vypnutý kliknutím na efekt klipu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:193
msgid "Effect Functions"
msgstr "Funkcie efektu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:200
msgid "selection-raise"
msgstr "selection-raise"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:202
msgid "selection-lower"
msgstr "selection-lower"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:204
msgid "adjustlevels2"
msgstr "adjustlevels2"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:210
msgid "Kdenlive Effect Panel"
msgstr "Panel efektov Kdenlive"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:216
msgid ""
"|go-down| Expand/collapse the effect panel. :kbd:`Shift + click` to expand/"
"collapse all effects"
msgstr ""
"|go-down| Rozbaliť/zbaliť panel efektu. :kbd:`Shift + click` rozbalí/zbalí "
"všetky efekty"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:218
msgid ""
"|keyframe-disable| Hide/show keyframes - Turns the display of the keyframe "
"ruler off or on"
msgstr ""
"|keyframe-disable| Skryť/zobraziť kľúčové snímky – Zapína alebo vypína "
"zobrazenie pravítka kľúčových snímok"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:220
msgid ""
"|zoom-fit-width| Use effect zone - Toggles the display to show the :ref:"
"`effect zone <effects-effect_zones>`"
msgstr ""
"|zoom-fit-width| Použiť zónu efektu – Prepína zobrazenie na :ref:`zónu "
"efektu <effects-effect_zones>`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:222
msgid ""
"|visibility| Disable effect - Turns the effect off or on. The effect stays "
"in the stack but is not applied during playback or rendering."
msgstr ""
"|visibility| Vypnúť efekt – Zapína alebo vypína efekt. Efekt zostáva v "
"zásobníku, ale pri prehrávaní ani renderovaní sa nepoužije."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:224
msgid ""
"|adjustlevels2| Presets - Opens a list of advanced options to manage presets "
"for the effect (e.g. reset the effect to its default parameters)."
msgstr ""
"|adjustlevels2| Predvoľby – Otvorí zoznam rozšírených možností na správu "
"predvolieb efektu (napr. obnovenie predvolených parametrov efektu)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:226
msgid ""
"|document-save| Save effect - Opens a dialog window for entering a name for "
"the effect under which it will be listed in the *Custom* effect category and "
"a comment which will be displayed in the information display"
msgstr ""
"|document-save| Uložiť efekt – Otvorí dialógové okno na zadanie názvu "
"efektu, pod ktorým bude uvedený v kategórii efektov *Custom*, a komentára, "
"ktorý sa zobrazí v informačnom paneli"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:228
msgid ""
"|help-about| Open effect documentation in browser  - This opens the online "
"documentation to this effect"
msgstr ""
"|help-about| Otvoriť dokumentáciu efektu v prehliadači – Otvorí online "
"dokumentáciu k danému efektu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:230
msgid ""
"|selection-raise| Move effect up - Moves the effect up one notch in the list "
