#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:249
msgid ""
"The tooltip :guilabel:`use \"%...\" to reference other spinbox's value` "
"shows which other parameter you can use in the formula: positions, size, "
"scale, opacity, number of value field (use :kbd:`%x` :kbd:`%y` :kbd:`%w` :"
"kbd:`%h` :kbd:`%s` :kbd:`%o` :kbd:`%1-n`). If an effect has several fields "
"with the same type of value, it shows a number like :kbd:`%3`. You can add a "
"basic math to that link like: :kbd:`%y*2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_filters.rst:254
